Test ROM I developed when trying to figure out some issues with the
RAM on an E7 burgertime cartridge (with custom ROM/RAM replacement).

Run it to the title screen

Press joystick button 6 times to step through the ROM tests.  If all goes
well after each time you will have a black screen showing

   07feffff

0=rom bank, 7fe = it walked through 2k of ROM testing values
ffff = no errors reported

The ROM banks are written so the values PZZZ are written, where
P is the page and ZZZ is th 10-bit address of the location.

if the background color changes it means an unexpected value was returned
and the right 4 hex digits should show the last address that didn't match.
